  },
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "cda17be226ee3785159b",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "终于等到你的笑了，等多久都值得。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "cda17be226ee3785159b.mp3",
      "bytes": 46750,
      "sha256": "e148390246f0598c22eb03f2cb5d607685042c0fe0746e0966e7dda73a7888d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "81c60f09eb1544a853e8",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "陛下，再来一颗？最甜的这颗留给你。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "81c60f09eb1544a853e8.mp3",
      "bytes": 45810,
      "sha256": "79a078b93f525c10525ecab8ac7dbebc0d3797073a5ff7e0f954036cadfe75b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5ff806d07d46ee2360c",
      "actor": "KAEL",
      "text": "好。我在这里。若你想换一种方式，随时告诉我。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "f5ff806d07d46ee2360c.mp3",
      "bytes": 52706,
      "sha256": "e37f5ab50d728eaced089e2eff05a605f088f98cae34d23f872de906008b9400"
    },
    {
      "id": "2da7bbf2f815b3e7af67",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我想坐在你身边。这次我会好好请求。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "2da7bbf2f815b3e7af67.mp3",
      "bytes": 60230,
      "sha256": "4cbb45a76712ef970fce1c3352be2e2d179547563a3cd01e5407d2ff9dd11182"
    },
    {
      "id": "e22659a4bbc5583b2428",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "我来安排座位。任何人都不必勉强留下。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "e22659a4bbc5583b2428.mp3",
      "bytes": 35466,
      "sha256": "5075769b3283a648dda72327d1b58ba95b99a1af7d4c60716cd32c8271ca4fc7"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa3a59d5b3f02f4ce710",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "那就让我给你腾个位置。日程可以稍等。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "aa3a59d5b3f02f4ce710.mp3",
      "bytes": 38287,
      "sha256": "e1fe5c6308f3e6287fce95a2f69291e7c1be251e662f9e30384880cb87d16fde"
    },
    {
      "id": "f391c4ea84a7f985ab45",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "我只希望陛下能安稳休息片刻。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "f391c4ea84a7f985ab45.mp3",
      "bytes": 27629,
      "sha256": "16c401d17cc919cd22039fa131e942654ff5a923471b1ca9185377db9872a377"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6ebba0135a6fec68a5c",
      "actor": "FINN",
      "text": "音乐交给我。我保证也给别人开口的机会。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "f6ebba0135a6fec68a5c.mp3",
      "bytes": 57408,
      "sha256": "1af7c8f333eddf3fcda610ff6e030702c0de8d4ffd8ece6086081e1a503c51d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "658a4f5e2ddf2b0b04be",
      "actor": "ELIAS",
      "text": "陛下，午夜之前，有件事你必须知道。",
      "voice": "m2",
      "file": "658a4f5e2ddf2b0b04be.mp3",
      "bytes": 41108,
      "sha256": "47ad7fbc2f306c70df31047f3db1a757f6955a934bd4b49a7cb60b0c40186761"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a221f3329f790b1caed",
      "actor": "ELIAS",
      "text": "告诉我你需要什么。我会先听清，再行动。",
      "voice": "m2",
      "file": "8a221f3329f790b1caed.mp3",
      "bytes": 42989,
      "sha256": "3be3f89957888f6a22cdec6af519d19f7cb4a4911099d991bb81847c605a2a97"
    },
    {
      "id": "616094617d22ea6f254d",
      "actor": "VALERIAN",
      "text": "有人进过你的寝宫。我一定查出是谁。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "616094617d22ea6f254d.mp3",
      "bytes": 34525,
      "sha256": "ff5c2402e8f56da8cc478877bee59a07327d0ea428b343e40432ee29e03f43d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "2e7c312247de7d654f86",
      "actor": "VALERIAN",
      "text": "我会照你的意思做，不会越界。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "2e7c312247de7d654f86.mp3",
      "bytes": 26688,
      "sha256": "246a78661622f10419702c09e7925f15de6598c348fd83b79df42059f064f6e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "4bd7079c099102569965",
      "actor": "FINN",
      "text": "我为你的早餐写了首歌，而且毫不后悔。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "4bd7079c099102569965.mp3",
      "bytes": 42989,
      "sha256": "76187d9ba5b6381217ee36fe4c0faec125c2bacfb3ba3b15c77663321bb8b3e3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5757f0ba85fcf8ea0402",
      "actor": "ROWAN",
      "text": "我们慢慢来。让你舒服最要紧。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "5757f0ba85fcf8ea0402.mp3",
      "bytes": 39227,
      "sha256": "8b8e1464c3515516b0208c88e3f3d2a2ef952815508494cbecad6d8663daeecc"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6667ae9b508a7cfe359",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我保证不炫耀。至少不会太过分。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "b6667ae9b508a7cfe359.mp3",
      "bytes": 39227,
      "sha256": "7789213b6e767f5ac5864603cf0a8e98c1f352c59e778251ed73d2760a0fd47a"
    },
    {
      "id": "939ecb39aa737fa3970a",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "当然。你不欠我时间，也不必向我解释。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "939ecb39aa737fa3970a.mp3",
      "bytes": 48004,
      "sha256": "ddf9070965a41f086ec936f1f7407a5b9d4196ff21403e2da0e149124e30ef5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5eaa08fdd64e4e7075b",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "你亲手赐的礼物，比整座国库都珍贵。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "d5eaa08fdd64e4e7075b.mp3",
      "bytes": 39227,
      "sha256": "0a46b3dfd24c88ba2137e6bd427db8a136b627e70f368c97572e13625be72220"
    },
    {
      "id": "f096c4cb8c6518aeddfb",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我来这里时另有所图。可后来，一切都变了。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "f096c4cb8c6518aeddfb.mp3",
      "bytes": 74649,
      "sha256": "3362696420aaae9094906232b5c290c22e9e83ccb14ceb04faaca5848ff29a9c"
    },
    {
      "id": "1444d77dfa0eb9fda1ec",
      "actor": "DARIAN",
      "text": "不是我让玉牌发光的。别盯着我看。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "1444d77dfa0eb9fda1ec.mp3",
      "bytes": 29510,
      "sha256": "a445ce831493a90a078b962a6a19888796a430b1375593d1e4d7db68450e2ccc"
    },
    {
      "id": "3b192075d3a37cca6d08",
      "actor": "SYLAS",
      "text": "有些短暂的相伴，会比漫长的夜晚更难忘。",
      "voice": "m7",
      "file": "3b192075d3a37cca6d08.mp3",
      "bytes": 64305,
      "sha256": "56f2740f18bf84b1f52174ab646131f3c69719c843f0587bac0f074d15395798"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7f5ba0a0586d4aa59c5",
      "actor": "DARIAN",
      "text": "由你决定。我会让这段时间值得。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "a7f5ba0a0586d4aa59c5.mp3",
      "bytes": 33585,
      "sha256": "41f0ac5ead4df60cc8439fea37af2b92bd5c476e8e5202dadbc06537e469dbc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33803b1f55f49312c81",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我想留下，但前提是你也愿意。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "c33803b1f55f49312c81.mp3",
      "bytes": 46750,
      "sha256": "a770f3658db806d5aae903b29b87dfabd360e70c4411ea866aa0b9a85ed393cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "a59f2a589e98cd84b1bd",
      "actor": "FINN",
      "text": "这一刻值得记住。放心，我不编押韵的句子了。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "a59f2a589e98cd84b1bd.mp3",
      "bytes": 55528,
      "sha256": "0f5cd304a3c99137f75bd82d22d5f4fab8c019d34cc036268b4c95fe18fa04b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a969ee71ed01d4651b1",
      "actor": "SERAPHINE",
      "text": "王冠选中了你，因为你有能力打破它。",
      "voice": "f1",
      "file": "9a969ee71ed01d4651b1.mp3",
      "bytes": 45810,
      "sha256": "b358fa63a126cdca28dc7f9d7f79e578e55030a45c8bec34e9b28c489d2e6698"
    },
    {
      "id": "4ec28a15350b02acfb00",
      "actor": "ALISTAIR",
      "text": "我们一步一步来，看看能发现什么。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "4ec28a15350b02acfb00.mp3",
      "bytes": 38287,
      "sha256": "b738cc2b3fc49d904ced215f34f0ae5755b983dd12df689f62541c87ec7df1eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "59c12a9f1dea0258ea2f",
      "actor": "NOEL",
      "text": "谢谢你愿意告诉我。我宁可听到真话。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "59c12a9f1dea0258ea2f.mp3",
      "bytes": 42989,
      "sha256": "af5757b04f375828ba8b0f473036f1420c44a03021c35fd68b967cfe5da8e5d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "421f9eb6686f4eef89c0",
      "actor": "NOEL",
      "text": "我想着，你也许会喜欢这些。我盼着你喜欢。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "421f9eb6686f4eef89c0.mp3",
      "bytes": 65245,
      "sha256": "088293ab222e48b250aad1a461d5da02a773eb97c4cc48772c116bb731e626e6"
    },
    {
      "id": "288d0a1beb87a759426b",
      "actor": "NOEL",
      "text": "我嫉妒了。对不起。但嫉妒不能成为借口。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "288d0a1beb87a759426b.mp3",
      "bytes": 62110,
      "sha256": "e6040b986e3fc3f41db1b98f9027f183582d64496e07ba6f89bea05bc9ee0474"
    },
    {
      "id": "7b7b6121f87c89fbd5e9",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我想你了，也盼着你会有一点想我。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "7b7b6121f87c89fbd5e9.mp3",
      "bytes": 49885,
      "sha256": "857f8cd03029d82908b4279d6d2441e2dff05842cfdeec6d68c7bd3a46ce6bda"
    },
    {
      "id": "273189b957213245f0d4",
      "actor": "SYLAS",
      "text": "有人用王冠的真名伤了我。",
      "voice": "m7",
      "file": "273189b957213245f0d4.mp3",
      "bytes": 28569,
      "sha256": "b376a3e70dfcce055477635eb09beff07befee99a4c3d42a95b48b02a095b7d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "f568332ea8f9aab4672c",
      "actor": "RAFAEL",
      "text": "诸位，既然要争，那就争得漂亮一点。",
      "voice": "m4",
      "file": "f568332ea8f9aab4672c.mp3",
      "bytes": 33585,
      "sha256": "b116dd6e1b4e450de70a533d2387b085a072041112559ffc4510d52c580be42a"
    },
    {
      "id": "b73236003c5442836eee",
      "actor": "FINN",
      "text": "她统御群星与海洋，却没人给我留一支舞。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "b73236003c5442836eee.mp3",
      "bytes": 63364,
      "sha256": "4ebb2f6460e3459c9a2d13046c30f3665b7c4a807c2f473ddacf4aff84d07689"
    },
    {
      "id": "5998a9c667b31665dd2b",
      "actor": "ELIAS",
      "text": "别喝！这是记忆封印！",
      "voice": "m2",
      "file": "5998a9c667b31665dd2b.mp3",
      "bytes": 23867,
      "sha256": "1b13698861c7abf58046f5b266f3e231975e40bf8f3f630b1054f965defa9a67"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf3c82b5a80452a76491",
      "actor": "RAFAEL",
      "text": "除非你愿意，否则不必有观众。此刻只属于我们。",
      "voice": "m4",
      "file": "bf3c82b5a80452a76491.mp3",
      "bytes": 59289,
      "sha256": "d316637e2ea100668222a343fe368e29f185c27177edc20b67aa9933ab7933c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8625c708d8935cc6181",
      "actor": "FINN",
      "text": "不是刺客。是王冠杀了他。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "c8625c708d8935cc6181.mp3",
      "bytes": 30450,
      "sha256": "7cfab771c8b64f04d56c37d08beb860c1c617def8745307f20f970eb3f4f2e1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "af2a6b0e23e5b5b90c4d",
      "actor": "ALISTAIR",
      "text": "历史没有忘记她，是有人抹去了她。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "af2a6b0e23e5b5b90c4d.mp3",
      "bytes": 40168,
      "sha256": "08843dff8abfbb7ba4fcaf9dccdbb247ecf22489907e212dfaec3258b6fdfdb7"
    },
    {
      "id": "adf5a36ecfb54d5ee556",
      "actor": "ELIAS",
      "text": "这道咒术原本并不邪恶，是后来被人改写了。",
      "voice": "m2",
      "file": "adf5a36ecfb54d5ee556.mp3",
      "bytes": 42989,
      "sha256": "6e9f609d795b6e85e2aa35c2ecbaf7568db793129ee7296a678cbab6281f353c"
    },
    {
      "id": "abd93281a204fcc14d95",
      "actor": "VALERIAN",
      "text": "任何秘密，都不值得你失去自由。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "abd93281a204fcc14d95.mp3",
      "bytes": 27629,
      "sha256": "26fbf83b38130462bea4d32e7313cefe30b99d0bbc340f12b9123755a0ce8549"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0b9043b67c30a2d259",
      "actor": "KAEL",
      "text": "我留下是因为爱你，不是因为王冠命令我。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "3f0b9043b67c30a2d259.mp3",
      "bytes": 37346,
      "sha256": "9907a7173e26f35f8745d007d9e6d3240863e4699cc21033ab752ed5e7222796"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c016cb45b83bd60484c",
      "actor": "KAEL",
      "text": "当然。你不欠我时间，也不必向我解释。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "8c016cb45b83bd60484c.mp3",
      "bytes": 40168,
      "sha256": "780cc05cde97ad389547cd61de6876a6f2d899643a8a850fee21737973382e7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "207ff93b449340a8938c",
      "actor": "DARIAN",
      "text": "那东西是活的！到我身后！",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "207ff93b449340a8938c.mp3",
      "bytes": 32644,
      "sha256": "c5dc46d9f524b359d655687c9a6498c2d6f9097cd73c0cb8ab51c07d1a21149e"
    },
    {
      "id": "13d79ea86f723d3d4021",
      "actor": "KAEL",
      "text": "你受伤了吗？没有就好。那我就尽到了职责。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "13d79ea86f723d3d4021.mp3",
      "bytes": 59289,
      "sha256": "a35c19e208f5d05c94ed8dd974c70ba3eab594fe77149cd7b7448a1703b4a085"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae9a80989fa123a9fef9",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "他不能丢下我们，不能以这种方式。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "ae9a80989fa123a9fef9.mp3",
      "bytes": 51766,
      "sha256": "b3b89b12d5d6a42f362f8fe5d7110daf4b94f3432e58afe34d50fe5a50eceb68"
    },
    {
      "id": "46f66d56e746d231ede3",
      "actor": "ISAAC",
      "text": "把王冠给我，我就归还你的骑士。",
      "voice": "m3",
      "file": "46f66d56e746d231ede3.mp3",
      "bytes": 30450,
      "sha256": "f930dff86900ea3e78192a85efabbe2ad16955027c82fc357c4d501e1b164b73"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8ef436068ce49c620c8",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "头衔不能命令我爱谁。我选择你。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "e8ef436068ce49c620c8.mp3",
      "bytes": 43929,
      "sha256": "cddf4fcd5bfa20e01f13c6ae12dc556ae6cddc19c998a61bbac0b5ef6bec70d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "0c5f44fc13a20848b5ba",
      "actor": "CASSIAN",
      "text": "当然。你不欠我时间，也不必向我解释。",
      "voice": "m1",
      "file": "0c5f44fc13a20848b5ba.mp3",
      "bytes": 48004,
      "sha256": "87c8debc468e139fc7a7b9412cc1f79d32b676ff3a15e368f433031de59154fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "206a45086c9f5c6dbb0b",
      "actor": "SERAPHINE",
      "text": "王冠无法命令一颗自愿交付的心。",
      "voice": "f1",
      "file": "206a45086c9f5c6dbb0b.mp3",
      "bytes": 36406,
      "sha256": "9700d677f287a12f7315f80f853ce916b97b05caff4594b0c40329a7f406793e"
    },
    {
      "id": "c137c75d70a77921771a",
      "actor": "KAEL",
      "text": "我是不是错过了什么？我答应过要留下。",
      "voice": "m5",
      "file": "c137c75d70a77921771a.mp3",
      "bytes": 45810,
      "sha256": "df774d4a066fd145be8133d96636e0efe149abdd07691674da0892d44f883f72"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fe51a538337a201f0c8",
      "actor": "SERAPHINE",
      "text": "守住你的王座，也让他们守住自己的心。",
      "voice": "f1",
      "file": "2fe51a538337a201f0c8.mp3",
      "bytes": 38287,
      "sha256": "4539b24af368c93b89382c3b338b572b8e8eb5f8d954ca9fbbeecb97d9be144e"
    },
    {
      "id": "279fdc54e486aa7789f7",
      "actor": "LUCIEN",
      "text": "我有自己的感受。显然，轮值表没有。",
      "voice": "m6",
      "file": "279fdc54e486aa7789f7.mp3",
      "bytes": 61170,
